{{#*inline "title"}}Organization Created | Twennie{{/inline}}

<section class="success-container payment-success">
  <h1 class="registration-complete payment">organization created</h1>

  {{#if organizationName}}
    <p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-family: 'Figtree'; color: #262262; font-weight: 700;">
      {{organizationName}}
    </p>
  {{/if}}

  <p style="margin-top: 1.25rem; font-family: 'Figtree'; color: #262262; line-height: 1.5;">
    Your organization unlocks team-based learning features designed for technical consulting firms.
  </p>

  <div style="text-align: left; margin: 1.5rem auto 0 auto; max-width: 520px; font-family: 'Figtree'; color: #262262;">
    <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.7;">
      <li><strong>sharing learning across teams</strong> so momentum doesn’t rely on one person.</li>
      <li><strong>collaborating on exercises</strong> in business development, team building, and project management.</li>
      <li><strong>staging friendly learning competitions</strong> to keep engagement high (and fun).</li>
      <li><strong>organizational reporting</strong> on learning activity and participation.</li>
      <li><strong>developing custom organizational content</strong> and sharing it with your organization only.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <a class="dashboard-button" href="{{dashboardUrl}}">back to dashboard</a>
</section>
